(include_subdirs no)

; The layout model, extracted from theories/PtxLayout.v by LayoutExtract.v
; (task #46). This is the ONLY extracted artefact in this project that is
; compiled and linked; test/test_layout_conformance.ml runs it directly instead
; of the hand transcription it used to carry.
;
; Extract.v's output (AGpuSemantics.ml, PtxTypes.ml, PtxExprSpec.ml,
; PtxStmtSpec.ml, PtxKernelSpec.ml, in the project root) is deliberately NOT in
; this stanza. `Extraction Library` leaves those files opening Datatypes/List/Nat
; — modules that exist only if the Stdlib is extracted alongside them — so they
; do not compile as they stand. Adding them here would break the build, not fix
; anything. They are regenerated by every proof run and linked by nothing;
; migrating them to the self-contained form used here is separate work.
;
; The sources are extraction output, committed raw and listed in
; .ocamlformat-ignore so that regenerate-and-diff can tell a changed definition
; from a reformatting. Rocq's extractor emits code no human wrote: shadowed
; Stdlib names, redundant matches, unused bindings. The warnings below are
; silenced for that reason and no other — nothing in this directory is
; hand-edited, so a warning here can never be acted on.

(library
 (name sarek_ptx_layout_model)
 (modules sarek_ptx_layout_model)
 (flags
  (:standard -w -a)))
